It is a Tuesday evening.
It is raining heavily outside.
I return to the flat after my half-past-five gym workout.
My mobile connection details are required to be updated soon.
I usually put off such matters.
But today I decide to finish it quickly.
I make a cup of Mexican coffee.
I come and sit on the sofa with the coffee.
I usually drink this coffee after a workout.
I usually do such small things on the phone while drinking coffee.
So I take my phone.
I open the telecom company's website.
It is instructed in it to record the new details.
I drink the hot coffee.
The sound of rain can be heard at the window.
I begin to provide my account details.
